prompts.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept.
Asset type: transparent pixel-art PROP ATLAS for Hollow Choir, editable top-down three-quarter RPG environments. A sheet of reusable objects, not a composed landscape.
Square canvas 1536x1536, exactly FOUR equal columns and FOUR equal rows, cells384x384, each object centered within its own cell and entirely contained with generous transparent gutters. No grid, lines, labels or numbers. Coarse 16-bit pixel art, deliberate square clusters as if native 64x64 objects enlarged 6x. Warm near-black outlines; weathered muted materials, ivory stone, charcoal timber, olive moss, tarnished brass, no bright gold.
ROW 1 left to right:
1 a small freestanding town bell frame with soot-dark timber legs, ivory stone footings, tarnished brass bell and hanging LOW unraised clapper, no lamp;
2 the EXACT SAME town bell frame viewed at the EXACT SAME angle and scale, with only its clapper raised clearly inside the bell, no lamp;
3 a small wayside bell frame, gnarled roots around its ivory stone footings, tarnished bell with slack rope;
4 EXACT SAME wayside frame, same roots, same angle and scale, with taut raised rope and visible raised clapper.
ROW 2:
1 sturdy wooden preparation bench with a rolled ivory cloth and small sheathed tools, no writing;
2 weathered low timber latch gate CLOSED, two stone posts and a horizontal slatted gate;
3 EXACT SAME posts, angle and scale with the gate opened to one side so a clear walking gap is visible;
4 three upright listening stones, unequal heights, worn ivory surfaces and moss at base.
ROW 3:
1 an unlit iron and brass street lantern on a short post;
2 EXACT SAME lamp on same post, amber glass illuminated, NO external light cone or glow haze;
3 a cluster of olive marsh reeds, clear dark base, distinct tapered pixel leaves;
4 low pale bracket mushrooms on a charcoal fallen root, rust and moss accents.
ROW 4:
1 a low long charcoal fence segment with three posts;
2 matching compact reed-fence gate opening between two posts, NO glowing portal;
3 broad gnarled wetland willow canopy with dark charcoal trunk, sparse drooping olive foliage, separate readable foot;
4 low weathered ivory boulder cluster, moss only at bases.
All props viewed from fixed elevated top-down three-quarter RPG camera (see tops and fronts), no isometric diamonds, no slanted camera rotation. Upper-left tiny highlights only, no cast shadows or floor patches. Bell pairs and lamp pairs must keep identical silhouettes and positions for seamless swapping.
Genuine alpha transparency everywhere outside props. No background color, terrain, checkerboard, scene, UI, words or watermark.
